{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/9a85c950a77ea6a15131b56c7ea07ef2.avif?t=1761655281\" width=300 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back into the late '90s with God Help Us All, a fixed-camera horror western game that will test your will to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious sickness is spreading through the arid lands of Los Cuervos town, turning the locals into something monstrous. It's up to you to uncover the truth before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/878b130b3c595dad453f569a7d2e56b3.poster.avif?t=1761655281\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/878b130b3c595dad453f569a7d2e56b3.webm?t=1761655281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/878b130b3c595dad453f569a7d2e56b3.mp4?t=1761655281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/aaca47c400b111b71a32f13c84da414e.avif?t=1761655281\" width=300 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of survival horror, God Help Us All features are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/9943ae42c0a154c99b93d2682a2db3d5.poster.avif?t=1761655281\" width=600 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/9943ae42c0a154c99b93d2682a2db3d5.webm?t=1761655281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/9943ae42c0a154c99b93d2682a2db3d5.mp4?t=1761655281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival Gameplay:</strong> Navigate the terrifying town of Los Cuervos and its surroundings with limited resources and a fixed-camera perspective that keeps you on edge. Every corner could hide a new threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old-School Pre-Rendered Backgrounds:</strong> Immerse yourself in the gritty, unsettling atmosphere of a forgotten era. The stunning pre-rendered backgrounds bring the haunting world to life, making every location feel both beautiful and dangerous.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Upgrades &amp; Crafting:</strong> Use parts and improve your weapons to stand a fighting chance against the horrors that await. Will you be able to fend off the spreading evil, or will you become a victim of the sickness?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild West Grittiness:</strong> The unforgiving landscape of the Wild West adds a unique layer of tension to this survival horror game. Get ready to face the darkest secrets of Los Cuervos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1967440?t=1761655281","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1967440?t=1761655281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/d89f606ed1f6ca18f04c3e9da851a030547ccb91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761655281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/d89f606ed1f6ca18f04c3e9da851a030547ccb91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761655281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of gun violence and graphic content. It also explores religious themes, blending horror with elements of Christianity and figures like Jesus."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/9a85c950a77ea6a15131b56c7ea07ef2.avif?t=1761655281\" width=300 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back into the late '90s with God Help Us All, a fixed-camera horror western game that will test your will to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious sickness is spreading through the arid lands of Los Cuervos town, turning the locals into something monstrous. It's up to you to uncover the truth before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/878b130b3c595dad453f569a7d2e56b3.poster.avif?t=1761655281\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/878b130b3c595dad453f569a7d2e56b3.webm?t=1761655281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/878b130b3c595dad453f569a7d2e56b3.mp4?t=1761655281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1967440/extras/aaca47c400b111b71a32f13c84da414e.avif?t=1761655281\" wid